                <pb facs="0098" n="33" sameAs="frus:frus1936v03/pg33"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">783.003/139: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fish</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-28T16:00:00+02:00">December 28, 1936—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 28—11:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>78. I learn unofficially that the Capitulations Conference will be held April 19
                    at Montreux, Switzerland. It is expected that we shall receive detailed
                    proposals not later than the end of January.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
